  "sort_order": "3572",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe EMT Pants are designed for comfort and utility, ensuring emergency medical technicians (EMTs) can respond swiftly without distraction. Made from a durable cotton-polyester blend, these pants feature an enhanced waistband for increased mobility, hidden elastic-slider waistband for a comfortable fit, and gripper waistband to keep your shirt neatly tucked in. With multiple pockets including deep reinforced front slash pockets, large button-down cargo pockets, hidden zipper pocket, back pockets, and calf pockets, these pants provide ample storage for essential EMS gear. The reinforced knees help prevent wear and tear, making them ideal for EMTs, paramedics, and other first responder personnel.</p>",
